{"page":228,"verses":[{"verse_key":"11:54","surah":11,"ayah":54,"ar_uthmani":"إِن نَّقُولُ إِلَّا ٱعْتَرَىٰكَ بَعْضُ ءَالِهَتِنَا بِسُوٓءٍ ۗ قَالَ إِنِّىٓ أُشْهِدُ ٱللَّهَ وَٱشْهَدُوٓا۟ أَنِّى بَرِىٓءٌ مِّمَّا تُشْرِكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"All we can say is that one of our gods may have inflicted some harm on you.’ He said, ‘I call God to witness, and you too are my witnesses, that I disown those you set up as partners with God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"11:54"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَّقُولُ","en_gloss":"we say","transliteration":"naqūlu","verse_key":"11:54"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except (that)","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"11:54"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱعْتَرَىٰكَ","en_gloss":"have seized you","transliteration":"iʿ'tarāka","verse_key":"11:54"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَعْضُ","en_gloss":"some","transliteration":"baʿḍu","verse_key":"11:54"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ءَالِهَتِنَا","en_gloss":"(of) our gods","transliteration":"ālihatinā","verse_key":"11:54"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِسُوٓءٍۢ ۗ","en_gloss":"with evil","transliteration":"bisūin","verse_key":"11:54"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"11:54"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِنِّىٓ","en_gloss":"Indeed, I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"11:54"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أُشْهِدُ","en_gloss":"[I] call Allah to witness","transliteration":"ush'hidu","verse_key":"11:54"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"[I] call Allah to witness","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"11:54"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱشْهَدُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and (you) bear witness","transliteration":"wa-ish'hadū","verse_key":"11:54"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَنِّى","en_gloss":"that I am","transliteration":"annī","verse_key":"11:54"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَرِىٓءٌۭ","en_gloss":"innocent","transliteration":"barīon","verse_key":"11:54"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِّمَّا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"11:54"},{"pos":16,"ar":"تُشْرِكُونَ","en_gloss":"you associate","transliteration":"tush'rikūna","verse_key":"11:54"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٥٤","en_gloss":"(54)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:54"}]},{"verse_key":"11:55","surah":11,"ayah":55,"ar_uthmani":"مِن دُونِهِۦ ۖ فَكِيدُونِى جَمِيعًا ثُمَّ لَا تُنظِرُونِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So plot against me, all of you, and give me no respite.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"Other than Him","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"11:55"},{"pos":2,"ar":"دُونِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"Other than Him","transliteration":"dūnihi","verse_key":"11:55"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَكِيدُونِى","en_gloss":"So plot against me","transliteration":"fakīdūnī","verse_key":"11:55"},{"pos":4,"ar":"جَمِيعًۭا","en_gloss":"all together","transliteration":"jamīʿan","verse_key":"11:55"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"11:55"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"11:55"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تُنظِرُونِ","en_gloss":"give me respite","transliteration":"tunẓirūni","verse_key":"11:55"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٥٥","en_gloss":"(55)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:55"}]},{"verse_key":"11:56","surah":11,"ayah":56,"ar_uthmani":"إِنِّى تَوَكَّلْتُ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ رَبِّى وَرَبِّكُم ۚ مَّا مِن دَآبَّةٍ إِلَّا هُوَ ءَاخِذٌۢ بِنَاصِيَتِهَآ ۚ إِنَّ رَبِّى عَلَىٰ صِرَٰطٍ مُّسْتَقِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"I put my trust in God, my Lord and your Lord. There is no moving creature which He does not control. My Lord’s way is straight.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنِّى","en_gloss":"Indeed, I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَوَكَّلْتُ","en_gloss":"[I] put my trust","transliteration":"tawakkaltu","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"upon","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَبِّى","en_gloss":"my Lord","transliteration":"rabbī","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَرَبِّكُم ۚ","en_gloss":"and your Lord","transliteration":"warabbikum","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"(There is) not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of a moving creature","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":9,"ar":"دَآبَّةٍ","en_gloss":"of a moving creature","transliteration":"dābbatin","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":11,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ءَاخِذٌۢ","en_gloss":"has grasp","transliteration":"ākhidhun","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِنَاصِيَتِهَآ ۚ","en_gloss":"of its forelock","transliteration":"bināṣiyatihā","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":15,"ar":"رَبِّى","en_gloss":"my Lord","transliteration":"rabbī","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"(is) on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":17,"ar":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","en_gloss":"a path","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","en_gloss":"straight","transliteration":"mus'taqīmin","verse_key":"11:56"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٥٦","en_gloss":"(56)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:56"}]},{"verse_key":"11:57","surah":11,"ayah":57,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِن تَوَلَّوْا۟ فَقَدْ أَبْلَغْتُكُم مَّآ أُرْسِلْتُ بِهِۦٓ إِلَيْكُمْ ۚ وَيَسْتَخْلِفُ رَبِّى قَوْمًا غَيْرَكُمْ وَلَا تَضُرُّونَهُۥ شَيْـًٔا ۚ إِنَّ رَبِّى عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ حَفِيظٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But if you turn away, then I have conveyed the message with which I was sent to you, and my Lord will bring along another people in your place. You cannot do Him any harm: it is my Lord who protects everything.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"So if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"11:57"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَوَلَّوْا۟","en_gloss":"you turn away","transliteration":"tawallaw","verse_key":"11:57"},{"p