58","surah":11,"ayah":58,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا جَآءَ أَمْرُنَا نَجَّيْنَا هُودًا وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ مَعَهُۥ بِرَحْمَةٍ مِّنَّا وَنَجَّيْنَـٰهُم مِّنْ عَذَابٍ غَلِيظٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"And so, when Our judgement came to pass, by Our grace We saved Hud and his fellow believers. We saved them from a severe punishment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"walammā","verse_key":"11:58"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَآءَ","en_gloss":"came","transliteration":"jāa","verse_key":"11:58"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَمْرُنَا","en_gloss":"Our command","transliteration":"amrunā","verse_key":"11:58"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَجَّيْنَا","en_gloss":"We saved","transliteration":"najjaynā","verse_key":"11:58"},{"pos":5,"ar":"هُودًۭا","en_gloss":"Hud","transliteration":"hūdan","verse_key":"11:58"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"and those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"11:58"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believed","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"11:58"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَعَهُۥ","en_gloss":"with him","transliteration":"maʿahu","verse_key":"11:58"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِرَحْمَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"by a Mercy","transliteration":"biraḥmatin","verse_key":"11:58"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنَّا","en_gloss":"from Us","transliteration":"minnā","verse_key":"11:58"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَنَجَّيْنَـٰهُم","en_gloss":"and We saved them","transliteration":"wanajjaynāhum","verse_key":"11:58"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"11:58"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَذَابٍ","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābin","verse_key":"11:58"},{"pos":14,"ar":"غَلِيظٍۢ","en_gloss":"severe","transliteration":"ghalīẓin","verse_key":"11:58"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٥٨","en_gloss":"(58)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:58"}]},{"verse_key":"11:59","surah":11,"ayah":59,"ar_uthmani":"وَتِلْكَ عَادٌ ۖ جَحَدُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ رَبِّهِمْ وَعَصَوْا۟ رُسُلَهُۥ وَٱتَّبَعُوٓا۟ أَمْرَ كُلِّ جَبَّارٍ عَنِيدٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"These were the Ad: they rejected their Lord’s signs, disobeyed His messengers, and followed the command of every obstinate tyrant.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَتِلْكَ","en_gloss":"And this","transliteration":"watil'ka","verse_key":"11:59"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَادٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"(was) Aad","transliteration":"ʿādun","verse_key":"11:59"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَحَدُوا۟","en_gloss":"they rejected","transliteration":"jaḥadū","verse_key":"11:59"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"(the) Signs","transliteration":"biāyāti","verse_key":"11:59"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ","en_gloss":"(of) their Lord","transliteration":"rabbihim","verse_key":"11:59"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَعَصَوْا۟","en_gloss":"and disobeyed","transliteration":"waʿaṣaw","verse_key":"11:59"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رُسُلَهُۥ","en_gloss":"His Messengers","transliteration":"rusulahu","verse_key":"11:59"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱتَّبَعُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and followed","transliteration":"wa-ittabaʿū","verse_key":"11:59"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَمْرَ","en_gloss":"(the) command","transliteration":"amra","verse_key":"11:59"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"(of) every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"11:59"},{"pos":11,"ar":"جَبَّارٍ","en_gloss":"tyrant","transliteration":"jabbārin","verse_key":"11:59"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَنِيدٍۢ","en_gloss":"obstinate","transliteration":"ʿanīdin","verse_key":"11:59"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٥٩","en_gloss":"(59)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:59"}]},{"verse_key":"11:60","surah":11,"ayah":60,"ar_uthmani":"وَأُتْبِعُوا۟ فِى هَـٰذِهِ ٱلدُّنْيَا لَعْنَةً وَيَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۗ أَلَآ إِنَّ عَادًا كَفَرُوا۟ رَبَّهُمْ ۗ أَلَا بُعْدًا لِّعَادٍ قَوْمِ هُودٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They were rejected in this life and so they shall be on the Day of Judgement. Yes, the 'Ad denied their Lord- so away with the Ad, the people of Hud!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأُتْبِعُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they were followed","transliteration":"wa-ut'biʿū","verse_key":"11:60"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse